{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Janabe Ummul Baneen (s.a.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا زَوْجَةَ وَلِىِّ اللهِ\nalssalamu `alayki ya zawjata waliyyi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O wife of the intimate servant of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا زَوْجَةَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya zawjata amiri almu'minina\npeace be upon you, O wife of the Commander of the Faithful,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ الْبَنِيْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya umma albanina\npeace be upon you, O mother of al-Banin (the sons),\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ الْعَبَّاسِ ابْنِ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya umma al`abbasi bni amiri almu'minina\npeace be upon you, O mother of al-`Abbas, son of the Commander of the Faithful,\nعَلِىِّ بْنِ اَبِىْ طَالِبٍ\n`aliyyi bni abi talibin\n`Ali the son of Abu Talib –\nرَضِىَ اللهُ تَعَالٰى عَنْكِ\nradiya allahu ta`ala `anki\nmay Allah, the Exalted, be pleased with you,\nوَ جَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَنْزِلَكِ وَ مَاْوٰيكِ\nwa ja`ala aljannata manzilaki wa ma'waki\nand may He make Paradise your abode and dwelling,\nوَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you."
}
